---
import { SITE_INFO } from '../../lib/siteInfo';
---
<footer class="bg-spa-charcoal text-[#D8D1C7] border-t border-[#3D3632]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-spa-taupe flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4C3B3]">
            <span class="font-editorial text-xl italic leading-none">M</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-editorial text-2xl tracking-[0.16em] font-medium text-spa-bg uppercase block">
              {SITE_INFO.name}
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] text-[#A69788] uppercase block">
              Spa &middot; Masajes &middot; Terapias
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-[#A89E95] font-light leading-relaxed">
          Tu refugio urbano para el bienestar consciente. Tratamientos terapéuticos, masajes de relajación y cuidado de la piel en un ambiente sereno.
        </p>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-1">
          <a
            href={SITE_INFO.instagram}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#3D3632] hover:bg-spa-taupe text-spa-cream flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
            aria-label="Instagram"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="0.6" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href={`https://wa.me/${SITE_INFO.whatsapp}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hola Mándala Spa, quisiera consultar por disponibilidades y servicios.')}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-[#3D3632] hover:bg-[#25D366] text-spa-cream hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center transition-colors"
            aria-label="WhatsApp"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-spa-bg mb-5">Tratamientos</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-[#B8AEA4]">
          <li><a href="/tienda" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Todos los servicios</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tienda" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Tienda</a></li>
          <li><a href="/gift-cards" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Gift Cards</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-spa-bg mb-5">Contacto</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm text-[#B8AEA4]">
          <li>
            <a href={`tel:${SITE_INFO.phone}`} class="hover:text-white transition-colors">{SITE_INFO.phone}</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={`mailto:${SITE_INFO.email}`} class="hover:text-white transition-colors break-all">{SITE_INFO.email}</a>
          </li>
          <li>{SITE_INFO.address}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-spa-bg mb-5">Horario de atención</h4>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-[#B8AEA4]">
          <p>{SITE_INFO.schedule}</p>
          <a
            href="/tienda"
            class="inline-flex w-full bg-spa-taupe hover:bg-[#9D8B7C] text-white py-2.5 px-4 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase transition-colors items-center justify-center gap-2"
          >
            Reservar hora
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-[#3D3632] bg-[#221E1B] py-5 text-xs text-[#8A8077]">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} {SITE_INFO.name}. Pagos procesados con Webpay Plus (Transbank).</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <a href="/gift-cards" class="hover:text-[#D4C3B3] transition-colors">Gift Cards</a>
        <span>&bull;</span>
        <a href="/carrito" class="hover:text-[#D4C3B3] transition-colors">Carrito</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
